gb5x(){return"This is where the trails you have ridden live, and those of your buddies \u2014 nobody else\u2019s. Three ways bring trails here: import a GPX, record a ride, connect with buddies. You can find the tour any time under Profile, \u201cQuick guide\u201d."},
