gb50(){return"Close to home"},
gb5_(){return"If a piece starts or ends near the start or finish of your ride, the app tells you \u2014 a ride often starts at your front door, and a trail should not give it away. Move the handle away if needed."},
gb56(){return"Save an area first"},
gb55(){return"The app only finds new pieces where it knows the ways \u2014 from a saved area. Save one over the ride (layers button on the map), then split it again from \u201cMy rides\u201d."},
