gaKa(){return"Avoid or don\u2019t mind"},
gaK9(){return"In the planner under \u201cSettings\u201d: roads, hiking trails uphill and steep ramps, each avoid or don\u2019t mind. Don\u2019t mind is not free \u2014 a fraction of the penalty remains. The device remembers your choice, and it applies to the route to a trail too."},
gaKg(){return"Flatter where possible"},
gaKf(){return"The planner and \u201cTo trail head\u201d count every metre of climbing above 10 % gradient extra, and the steeper, the more \u2014 on gravel and paths three times as much as on tarmac. A detour that climbs more gently then wins. Uphill trails never count as too steep."},
gaKo(){return"Heights without a recording"},
